            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye Nehemia, ndiye aliyekuwa Tirshatha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tazama Neh 7:65,70.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Ezra kuhani, mwandishi, na Walawi waliowafundisha watu, wakawaambia watu wote, Siku hii ni takatifu kwa BWANA, Mungu wenu; msiomboleze wala msilie. Maana watu wote walilia, walipoyasikia maneno ya torati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 9:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 11:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ufu 11:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kisha akawaambia, Nendeni zenu, mle kilichonona, na kunywa kilicho kitamu, tena mpelekeeni sehemu yeye asiyekuwa na kitu; maana siku hii ni takatifu kwa BWANA wetu; wala msihuzunike; kwa kuwa furaha ya BWANA ni nguvu zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo Walawi wakawatuliza watu wote, wakasema, Nyamazeni, kwa maana siku hii ni takatifu; wala msihuzunike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na watu wote wakaenda zao kula na kunywa, na kuwapelekea watu sehemu, na kufanya furaha nyingi, kwa sababu walikuwa wameyafahamu maneno yale waliyohubiriwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
